---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Photography Use and Permissions"
  description="How to request written permission to publish, reproduce, display, or otherwise use photography by Ryan D. Lewis."
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Copyright and licensing</p>
    <h1>Photography Use and Permissions</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>Ownership</h2>
      <p>The photographs are owned by Ryan D. Lewis. Red River Gorge Hiker is the public brand. Unless written permission says otherwise, viewing, sharing a link, buying a physical product, or seeing a photograph displayed at a venue does not grant reproduction or publication rights.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Uses that may require written permission</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Editorial publication</li>
        <li>Commercial publication</li>
        <li>Marketing or advertising</li>
        <li>Website or social-media use by an organization</li>
        <li>Venue display using a reproduced copy</li>
        <li>Brochures, menus, posters, signs, or printed promotion</li>
        <li>Product or merchandise creation</li>
        <li>Documentary, video, presentation, or broadcast use</li>
        <li>Other reproduction, distribution, adaptation, or licensed use</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How to request permission</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a> and include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The photograph title or Catalog ID, if known</li>
        <li>Your name and organization</li>
        <li>The exact proposed use</li>
        <li>Where the photograph will appear</li>
        <li>Print quantity or expected digital reach</li>
        <li>Image size or placement</li>
        <li>Whether the use is commercial, editorial, nonprofit, or personal</li>
        <li>Geographic distribution</li>
        <li>How long the use will continue</li>
        <li>Requested file format</li>
        <li>Requested deadline</li>
        <li>Any proposed credit line</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Review</h2>
      <p>A request is not approved until Ryan provides written permission. Permission may be declined, limited to a particular use, conditioned on attribution, restricted by duration or distribution, or subject to a fee or separate written license.</p>
      <p>No clean production-resolution file is provided merely because a request is submitted. The file supplied, if any, will be appropriate to the approved use.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Default credit</h2>
      <p><strong>Photography by Ryan D. Lewis | RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</strong></p>
      <p>A different credit line may be required in the written permission.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Physical display requests</h2>
      <p>A restaurant, lodging business, visitor-oriented organization, gallery, or regional partner may ask about a physical display. The arrangement should document the photograph, physical object, owner, production source, size, material, location, installation, duration, sale status, price if applicable, commission if applicable, payment process, insurance or damage responsibility, removal, marketing use, and contact person.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Reporting possible misuse</h2>
      <p>A possible unauthorized use may be reported to <a href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a>. Include the page or location, the photograph involved, screenshots when helpful, and enough information to identify the use.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
